## Summary Diagram

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                        Browser (Client)                         │
│                                                                 │
│  1. Sends POST with: thread_id, messages, state, client_tools  │
│                                                                 │
│  2. Receives SSE stream of AG-UI events                        │
│     - TextMessageContentEvent (streaming text)                 │
│     - ToolCallStartEvent / ToolCallArgsEvent / ToolCallEndEvent│
│     - ToolCallResultEvent (server-executed tool results)       │
│     - StateSnapshotEvent, MessagesSnapshotEvent                │
│                                                                 │
│  3. When LLM calls a CLIENT tool:                              │
│     - Client executes it locally                               │
│     - Sends result back in next request as tool message        │
│                                                                 │
│  4. When LLM calls a SERVER tool:                              │
│     - Server already executed it, result arrives in SSE stream │
│     - Client just displays the result                          │
└──────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────┘
                           │ SSE (text/event-stream)
                           ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                      Server (Hosted Agent)                      │
│                                                                 │
│  1. Looks up/creates AgentSession by thread_id                 │
│  2. Merges client_tools + server_tools for LLM                 │
│  3. Registers client tools as declaration-only (no exec)       │
│  4. Runs agent with merged tools, streams response             │
│  5. Server tools execute on server; results in SSE stream      │
│  6. Session saved after streaming completes                    │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

The key mechanisms are:

| Concern | Mechanism |
|---|---|
| **Session restoration** | `thread_id` in every request → `AgentSession` lookup/creation → message history persisted in session and/or LLM provider |
| **Streaming** | SSE (`text/event-stream`) with encoded AG-UI events (`RunStarted`, `TextMessage*`, `ToolCall*`, `StateSnapshot`, `MessagesSnapshot`, `RunFinished`) |
| **Tool separation** | Client tool name set built from request → server-side filtering removes server tools from mixed responses → client-side wrapping/unwrapping via `server_function_call` / `ServerFunctionCallContent` → client tools execute locally, server tools already executed |

